-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data files
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  bin/python/asset_management/web/static/dashboard_builder/admin1.geojson
    First-level administrative boundary polygons (states / provinces) for a
    set of countries, used by the Dashboard Builder's region map. Derived
    from Natural Earth "Admin 1 – States, Provinces" (naturalearthdata.com),
    reduced to the `admin`, `name` and `name_en` properties and to the
    countries the map needs. Natural Earth data is in the public domain; no
    attribution is required, and we give it here with thanks.

